import{c as t,Q as r,j as o,m as a}from"./chunks/framework.BXc4yaFE.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"How to make your Agentic Backend Architecture Production Ready?","description":"","frontmatter":{},"headers":[],"relativePath":"research/tweets/2026-06-09-@mfpiccolo-995141.md","filePath":"research/tweets/2026-06-09-@mfpiccolo-995141.md","lastUpdated":1785909234000}'),i={name:"research/tweets/2026-06-09-@mfpiccolo-995141.md"};function n(s,e,c,d,l,h){return r(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="how-to-make-your-agentic-backend-architecture-production-ready" tabindex="-1">How to make your Agentic Backend Architecture Production Ready? <a class="header-anchor" href="#how-to-make-your-agentic-backend-architecture-production-ready" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;How to make your Agentic Backend Architecture Production Ready?&quot;">​</a></h1><p><strong>來源</strong>：<a href="https://x.com/mfpiccolo/status/2064358779940995141" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">@mfpiccolo</a>（Mike Piccolo）<br><strong>日期</strong>：2026-06-09<br><strong>類型</strong>：Twitter Article<br><strong>統計</strong>：❤️ 226 · 🔁 29 · 👁 43817 · 🔖 453</p><hr><h2 id="tl-dr" tabindex="-1">TL;DR <a class="header-anchor" href="#tl-dr" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;TL;DR&quot;">​</a></h2><p>iii（iiidevs）框架將 Agentic Backend 拆解為四個可組合 Worker（harness/context-manager/session-manager/llm-router），無整合代碼，類比 React 將 UI 化為 Components——「Worker, Trigger, Function」為後端的基礎抽象。</p><hr><h2 id="核心論點" tabindex="-1">核心論點 <a class="header-anchor" href="#核心論點" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;核心論點&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li>Agentic Backend 可拆為四個獨立 Worker，各自可單獨安裝使用</li><li>harness 只負責序列化 agent turn loop，不含業務邏輯</li><li>各 Worker 通過 <code>iii.trigger()</code> 溝通，無整合框架、無服務 mesh</li><li>類比：iii 之於 Backend = React 之於 UI（Worker/Trigger/Function）</li><li>所有 Worker 共享同一引擎，queue/pubsub/cron/observability 都是函數呼叫</li></ol><hr><h2 id="關鍵數據-工具-引用" tabindex="-1">關鍵數據 / 工具 / 引用 <a class="header-anchor" href="#關鍵數據-工具-引用" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;關鍵數據 / 工具 / 引用&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>框架：iii（iiidevs），開源</li><li>核心 Worker：harness、context-manager、session-manager、llm-router</li><li>Repo：github.com/iii-hq/workers、github.com/iii-hq/iii</li><li>Docs：iii.dev/docs</li></ul><hr><h2 id="批判性觀察" tabindex="-1">批判性觀察 <a class="header-anchor" href="#批判性觀察" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;批判性觀察&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li>自家框架推廣，缺乏獨立使用者驗證和生產部署案例</li><li>&quot;Zero integration cost&quot; 主張需實際驗證，複雜場景可能有邊界</li><li>Discord CTA 結尾削弱文章的中立性</li></ol><hr><h2 id="_5-維度評分" tabindex="-1">5 維度評分 <a class="header-anchor" href="#_5-維度評分" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;5 維度評分&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>維度</th><th>分數</th><th>說明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>A. Workspace 可行動性 (30%)</td><td>7</td><td>具體架構 + 開源連結，可直接試用</td></tr><tr><td>B. 創新性 (20%)</td><td>7</td><td>React→Components 類比有說服力</td></tr><tr><td>C. 證據品質 (20%)</td><td>5</td><td>自家框架推廣，缺獨立驗證</td></tr><tr><td>D. 技術深度 (15%)</td><td>8</td><td>具體 trigger/worker 互動模式清晰</td></tr><tr><td>E. 泛化性 (15%)</td><td>7</td><td>適用 Agentic Backend 開發</td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>加權總分：6.75 → Agent</strong></p><hr><h2 id="整合決策" tabindex="-1">整合決策 <a class="header-anchor" href="#整合決策" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;整合決策&quot;">​</a></h2><p><strong>Agent</strong> — Worker 組合模式可參考設計 agentic backend 架構</p><hr><h2 id="全文" tabindex="-1">全文 <a class="header-anchor" href="#全文" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;全文&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Building an agentic backend on iii means composing a handful of workers on the engine. Each one is production-ready. Each one is replaceable. The composition is your backend.</p><p>If you see below in the image, harness sequences the agent turn loop. context-manager turns raw history into model-ready context. session-manager is a durable, reactive, branching store of typed conversation entries. llm-router is one front door over every LLM provider.</p><p>Each one is standalone. Install just llm-router and you have provider-agnostic completions for any app. Install just session-manager and you have a reactive conversation store. The harness only sequences the other three plus tool(i.e. function calls) dispatch. Anything that grows real logic, approval gating, spend budgets, multi-agent handoff, becomes its own sibling worker rather than complicating the harness.</p><p>From outside this looks like four layers. Inside there is no integration code between them. The harness calls the context-manager with iii.trigger(&quot;context::sync&quot;). The context-manager returns. The harness calls the llm-router. The llm-router streams over a channel. No orchestration framework to configure. No contract between layers to maintain. No service mesh to operate.</p><p>These four workers run on the same engine as queue worker, state worker, pubsub worker, observability worker, HTTP worker, sandbox worker, schedule/cron worker. Every worker inherits the rest, with zero integration cost. <code>iii worker add &lt;worker-name&gt;</code>, get the whole system surface. Adding queue support to your llm-router is calling iii.trigger(&quot;queue::enqueue&quot;). Adding scheduled retries is calling iii.trigger(&quot;cron::schedule&quot;). Adding observability is automatic. These are not separate integrations. They are functions on workers already running.</p><p>This is the @iiidevs pattern. We noticed complexity in backend engineering eventually demands abstraction, the same way @reactjs noticed it in UIs. React reduced UIs to Components. iii reduces backends to Worker, Trigger, Function.</p><p>The paradigm of &quot;add another service and integrate it into all others&quot; needs to end. Any capability you would have added as a service can be a worker on iii. The functionality is exposed as functions and triggers. What you get is a system that is composable, extensible, discoverable, and observable. One that gets more capable every time anyone adds a worker.</p><p>Join us in building the Agentic Backend that the modern world needs: discord.gg/iiidev</p><p>iii is open source. Get started at iii.dev/docs. The harness workers are at github.com/iii-hq/workers and the engine is at github.com/iii-hq/iii.</p>',32)])])}const p=t(i,[["render",n]]);export{g as __pageData,p as default};
